es to overcome your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innovative metamorphosis mechanic that multiplies the possibilities of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich universe. Discover the secrets of this tower and regain your freedom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and skills. Tame alien technologies to achieve your goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutscenes in sequence shot for a perfect immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242970/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.poster.avif?t=1737020763\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242970/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.webm?t=1737020763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242970/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.mp4?t=1737020763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Dive in Project Tower, a third-person shooter mixing intense bullet hell combat with a unique morphing ability. Imprisoned by the &quot;Hiks&quot;, fight to the top of their deadly tower for freedom. Will you outsmart them and make your way out ?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242970/header.jpg?t=1737020763", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2242970/3a80eefae032a7ea65357e0fec813e3d1a1017f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737020763", "capsule_imagev